DE1-SoC hardware and I2C base design

The repository adapts the DE1_SoC_Basic_Computer base design, including
the Cyclone V assignments and constraints, Nios II/f Platform Designer
system, SDRAM PLL, timers, GPIO wiring, bit-banged I2C and firmware
startup. The base design already included the hex7seg decoder. The original
display work connects it to the four digits of the packed temperature value. The I2C primitives in quartus/software/I2C_functions.c and I2C.h
come from that base design. The changes to those primitives are limited
to naming and comments. The base design's redistribution terms are
unverified. The MIT License covers original contributions only.

